STR_GRF_NAME :Hunninghall Skyline City International Airport 1.0
STR_GRF_DESC :White peaked terminal and teal glazing. Two runways, six stands and two helipads. Replaces the default international airport. Original aircraft movement and airside layout retained. Available from 1960.
STR_AIRPORT_NAME :Skyline City International Airport
STR_ADDITIONAL :White peaked terminal and teal glazing. Two runways, six stands and two helipads.
